<title>USA: Internet Communications names Greiving CFO.</title>
<headline>Internet Communications names Greiving CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWOOD VILLAGE, Colo. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internet Communications Corp said Wednesday it named Paul Greiving its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Internet Communications said Greiving is returning to the company as chief financial officer after spending the past year and a half as chief financial officer of Mincom Inc, a U.S. subsidiary of an Australian software development company.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available from the company.  </p>
<p>The company said Greiving is replacing Ben Kelly, who resigned in January.</p>
